{"seq":30,"slug":"api-versioning-evolution","title":"API 版本策略与演进","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution","rating":{"composite":4.12,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"api-版本策略与演进\">API 版本策略与演进</h1><p>API 版本管理是分布式系统中最具争议性的工程决策之一。版本号不只是一个数字——它是服务提供者与消费者之间的操作契约，决定了变更何时发生、如何传播、以及谁为兼容性负责。在微服务架构日益复杂的 2026 年，一次未经版本化的破坏性变更可以在数分钟内引发级联故障，击穿数百个下游集成。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 <strong>API 接口级别的版本控制与生命周期管理</strong>。内容覆盖四个层面：版本化的基础概念与方案选型（URI/Header/Query/内容协商）、演进策略（加性变更、废弃日落、破坏性变更管理）、工程实现（网关路由、内容协商机制、SDK 与客户端代码生成）、以及治理体系（生命周期策略、采纳率监控、文档与变更日志）。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻 hub 的分工边界：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>api-design</strong>：侧重 REST/GraphQL/gRPC 的接口设计原则（资源建模、错误码、幂等性），不涉及多版本共存与迁移路径</li>\n<li><strong>schema-evolution-data-contracts</strong>：侧重数据层 schema 演进（Protobuf 字段规则、Avro 兼容性矩阵、数据库扩缩模式），操作对象是数据契约而非 HTTP 接口契约</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 的切入点是 <strong>HTTP 接口的版本号</strong>——从客户端发出请求的那一刻起，版本号如何被识别、路由、协商、监控、直到最终退役。读者完成四章学习后，应具备为一个中等规模平台设计完整版本治理方案的能力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"版本化基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-overview","title":"API 版本化全景概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/foundations/versioning-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-schemes","title":"版本化方案比较与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/foundations/versioning-schemes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compatibility-contracts","title":"兼容性契约与变更分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/foundations/compatibility-contracts"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategies","title":"演进策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"additive-changes","title":"加性变更策略与无版本演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/additive-changes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deprecation-sunset","title":"废弃与日落流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/deprecation-sunset"},{"seq":3,"slug":"breaking-change-management","title":"破坏性变更管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/breaking-change-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"工程实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-routing","title":"网关路由与版本分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/implementation/gateway-routing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-negotiation","title":"内容协商与版本选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/implementation/content-negotiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sdk-client-generation","title":"SDK 与客户端代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/implementation/sdk-client-generation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"版本治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"version-lifecycle-policy","title":"版本生命周期策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/version-lifecycle-policy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-adoption","title":"监控与采纳率追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/monitoring-adoption"},{"seq":3,"slug":"documentation-changelog","title":"文档与变更日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/documentation-changelog"}]}]}